<title>Haiti's gang war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/haiti/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-haiti-2026-10-28T18:58:20.319Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 18:58:20 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;El Salvador has deployed roughly 1,000 troops to Haiti after a gang ambush near Port-au-Prince kidnapped four Salvadoran aviation technicians and bodies found were not those hostages. Haitian gangs launched a major attack on UN-backed troops, causing dozens of casualties, while the Dominican Republic summoned its ambassador to Haiti and reinforced its southern border to prevent spillover. Heavy rains triggered flooding and landslides that killed four people in Haiti, adding a humanitarian shock to the security crisis. The conflict produced 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxPV1FsRG13WUFFS1B2SUUwZ0prZzlWX1I2NE9jT2pqY0w3RWNoMG14NVIyWlVrNG4yZ0x0WFBBRXRFQkRaY0U1ZWlhdzRqZHZWWWhyRG9MNzBkQllQejE3U2RteWF1VU1nWk1FS1YtakRKSk9HV0otNGNlUUhSRVp4WlRZMWx4TmloUkF5anlWS0JPTWNTN1cxQVpJOTBhQ283dTBvMlJFZnlUUGVKQWNqdDFRZnVFS0Z0WnFxUktPR1R4VDFW?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPX3A0Z2dMclpLeWNSOTRfeVh3cXhTMWhnRnpwNEhnaXZXWl8tV3BKOFFZN25pWWtYS3NlNnRkd3FET0RhWlhPcFVNckQ1RW5sMldrRjQtMzY0ZDhJaXlDeDBsT1NsUF95NjFqRUFldXV2S055SjZkUjh1d2c2a3cwQjQwd1FEU1JNY1dXR3pwdUl1Uks0aWpUSXN6RFM0QzJ6VFBqb0F2YUhJa2ZfQ0ZOWHM0Mk5LckRv?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxPN3N0enNCa0pOSjQzZ0ZLcmJtZEdvY0JFNl95NkRWSkZOUGkwb0FLTmRCOWRGVEthTE1OZ0NHbjZkOUNMRFA3LU8tR1NSUVFwRVYybVl4N28ydjRGVU9sWUFWdF8xZE0zZzRwekE4UHpURnFLZjNmVnRCNURtOFhaOTh2bmQtcEN1MXdnS05HYVg3OVNQVDVVOFVUclVFMzQ0N1h0dnVydmsyT2hBNFY2bzFkd0xfNElWWGc4?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxNU2VMTHlRZmc5dkdpNXdCeUZVaVpDallyMVBMZFRXQkQyZUJvSUtLM1ZyRFhWM2lpWXNxc08tOTdVRk1DWEFCdUxjUGR2T2VhQWVmQVUx